sequenceDiagram
    participant Q as email.send
    participant W as worker
    participant D as Redis
    participant M as SMTP
    participant RQ as email.retry.30s
    Q->>W: job evt-3, attempt 1
    W->>D: SET notif:claim:evt-3 NX PX 120000
    W->>M: send
    M-->>W: 451 try again later
    W->>D: DEL claim
    W->>RQ: job, attempt 2 (confirmed)
    W->>Q: ack
    Note over RQ: 30 s TTL, then dead-lettered back
    RQ->>Q: job evt-3, attempt 2
    Q->>W: job evt-3, attempt 2
    W->>M: send
    M-->>W: 250 OK
    W->>D: SET notif:sent:evt-3 EX 7d
